Release 1.6.0.

Changelog: 20-11-2026 15:16:09

Release 1.5.1.

Changelog: 20-11-2026 14:57:33

Fixed. The app installs paramiko 5 (>=5.0,<6; it was >=3.4,<5). paramiko 5.0.0 is the release that fixes the known
vulnerabilities of the 3.x and 4.x versions, which the app could not take. An installed app gets it when it is
installed again from the portal, or with Nexus Deps' Fix.

