Changelog: 19-11-2026 21:22:43

Release 1.4.1.

Changelog: 19-11-2026 21:18:19

Fixed. When openssh-server is missing, Start sshd here's status gives the command for this system: sudo dnf install -y openssh-server on a flattened image (no ostree, such as a PS5 image, where rpm-ostree fails with "not booted via libostree"), rpm-ostree install and a reboot on an Atomic one (install_hint). The wiki's Set up the host says the same.

